    <statement><p>Find the equation of the ellipse with the given properties:</p>
<p>Vertices at <m>(\pm 81, 0)</m> and <m>(0,\pm 49)</m></p>
<p><fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/><m>=1</m></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{x^{2}}{6561}+\frac{y^{2}}{2401}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>{\left(\frac{x}{a}\right)}^{2}+{\left(\frac{y}{b}\right)}^{2}=1</m> with
<m>a=81</m> and <m>b=49</m>. That is,
<me>{\left(\frac{x}{81}\right)}^{2}+{\left(\frac{y}{49}\right)}^{2}=1</me>


</solution>
